daily_penny_ma_support_ema21_sma50_v1.py and
daily_penny_liquidity_sweep_breakout_v1.py are copies of the existing
daily_ma_support_ema21_sma50_v1.py / daily_liquidity_sweep_breakout_v1.py with
the pattern logic unchanged and:
- price universe 1 <= close <= 10 (min_price 1, new max_price 10)
- stocks whose ATR14 is under 1% of price skipped (pinned / takeover names)
- "Penny ($1-10)" in titles, "PENNY" in the email subject, daily_penny_* files
Generated by claude_run/tools/gen_penny_variants.py (each edit checked).

